{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7c1f2a30-9b4d-4a55-b1a0-7d2e8c6f1a02",
    "name": "FleetControl E2E",
    "description": "Happy-path end-to-end flow against a freshly booted FleetControl stack with no seeders. Captures the JWT, then creates a manager, driver, vehicle, route (planned/in-progress/completed), refuel and maintenance plan. Maintenance orders are not created on a fresh boot (only the daily scheduler at 06:00 UTC creates them), so the orders/list -> start -> complete chain skips itself when the list is empty. Each step writes minimal assertions so `newman run --bail` exits 0 on success.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54937856"
  },
